   $q$Kenji and Talia are "teammates." The word "team" is a clue. What are "teammates"?$q$, $q$[{"text":"people on the same team","is_correct":true},{"text":"players on different teams","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"reverses-meaning"},{"text":"people who coach a team","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"games played by two teams","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-person-with-event"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$people on the same team$q$, $q$A mate is a partner, so teammates are people on the same team, and Kenji and Talia both play for the Comets. They are not on different teams, since Talia passes the ball to Kenji.$q$, 'draft', '6b295ff7-237c-5b5e-aacc-7ca2c2cbbb3d')
