   $q$At first, Rohan "was uncomfortable with the mess." What does "uncomfortable" mean?$q$, $q$[{"text":"comfortable before","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-un-with-pre"},{"text":"comfortable again","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-un-with-re"},{"text":"not comfortable","is_correct":true},{"text":"very comfortable","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"ignores-prefix"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$not comfortable$q$, $q$The prefix un- means "not," so "uncomfortable" means not comfortable. The clay felt "cold and sticky," which shows Rohan did not feel at ease, not that Rohan felt very comfortable.$q$, 'draft', '27a59783-2e8d-5f9d-bdae-5045ea0f13f2')
