insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('d36acb1f-4af4-5e32-9259-5be55b560b88', 'rg4-comparing-texts-p07', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g4-comparing-texts'), null,
        '3-5', $q$What Elders Know$q$, $q$Text 1: Moon Stories (a story from Nigeria)

When the lights went out in the village, Chidi was upset. "Now there is nothing to do," he said.

His grandmother pulled a mat into the yard. The full moon shone bright. "Sit," she said. Then she told a story about a clever tortoise who wanted to fly. Neighbors' children came to listen. Soon the whole yard was full.

Grandmother's stories had lessons inside them, like seeds inside fruit. When she finished, Chidi asked for another. "Tomorrow," she said. "Then one day, you will tell them to your own children."

Text 2: Reading the Sky (a poem from Ireland)

Grandad points across the bay.
"See those clouds, all gray and low?
Rain will come before the tide.
Bring the washing in, Niamh, go!"

I laugh, because the sun is out.
But by the time the tide comes in,
the rain is drumming on the roof.
Grandad gives a knowing grin.

Now I watch the sky each day.
I learn the signs he learned from his.
Someday I will show a child
how to read it, just like this.$q$, 'draft')
