   $q$Where does the mother turtle dig her nest?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Inside a fence that volunteers build","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-sequence"},{"text":"Under the waves near the shore","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"},{"text":"Above the high tide line on the beach","is_correct":true},{"text":"Next to bright lights from buildings","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Above the high tide line on the beach$q$, $q$Paragraph 1 says she digs "above the high tide line." Volunteers put up fences after the nest is made, so the fence does not come first.$q$, 'draft', 'aa38fc50-7a12-59c6-9a5d-aa9b1a234f2d')
