   $q$What did the students do first to make the paper?$q$, $q$[{"text":"They tore scrap paper into small pieces.","is_correct":true},{"text":"They let the sheets dry for two days.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-sequence"},{"text":"They dipped a screen into a tub of pulp.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-sequence"},{"text":"They pressed petals into the wet sheets.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-sequence"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$They tore scrap paper into small pieces.$q$, $q$Paragraph 1 says, "First, the students tore scrap paper into small pieces." Dipping the screen came later, after the pulp was made.$q$, 'draft', 'ee21fe15-be92-549a-b517-6f490b41ac70')
