   $q$What is the author's main opinion in the passage?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Families should not go boating on the lake.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"The town pool should close in the mornings.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Every student should learn to swim before fifth grade.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Lifeguards should teach classes about boats.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Every student should learn to swim before fifth grade.$q$, $q$The first sentence says, "I believe every student in our town should learn to swim before fifth grade." The author mentions boating as a reason to swim, not as something to stop.$q$, 'draft', '850166be-003a-5eff-9d28-85c31ec646df')
