-- Passage rg4-literary-structure-pov-p08
insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('1e39d97b-4fda-56b5-83a2-ff759e4bb067', 'rg4-literary-structure-pov-p08', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g4-literary-structure-pov'), null,
        '3-5', $q$The Relay, Told Two Ways$q$, $q$Version One

I stood on the starting block and stared at the water. Our relay team was in last place, and I was the final swimmer. My heart pounded so loudly that I could barely hear the crowd. When Keiko touched the wall, I dove in. I kicked as hard as I could and never looked at the other lanes. I did not know we had won until I lifted my head and saw my team cheering.

Version Two

Diego stood on the starting block and stared at the water. His team was in last place, and he was the final swimmer. In the stands, his father gripped the railing and whispered, "Come on, Diego." When Keiko touched the wall, Diego dove in. He kicked hard and passed one swimmer, then another. The swimmer in lane four looked over in surprise. Diego touched the wall first. He did not know it until he lifted his head and saw his team cheering.$q$, 'draft')
